 "notes": "Rules used: elite-stage mechanics of the basic attack (skadi leap 破浪下劈, lp dance/claw 狼之舞, sa suit, sg crush/fis 破阵, su curl/flin/flout/flpulse, ir pick 挑刺, tx pin) -> atk. Growth/branch nodes (分支/成长节点) and late_shape 剑气 (qi*) -> talent even when triggered by a skill. Mon3tr body sprites + Mon3tr claw/melt/spike/pounce -> summon. raw* = fx/px_plane=2 old-look strips (fx_pxplane.gd mode 2) -> raw. 'skadi?' = unprefixed pxp_<stem> (generic fx_pxplane.gd = skadi); sk = skalter (only raw strips: raw_s1/s2/s3 + raw_wave). ult = irene ult seal (ult_px_ir.gd); ult_sd = skadi ult 斩浪 (ult_px_sd.gd).\nLow-confidence calls:\n- an: rib/band2/bandop -> s2 (绸带/环带); gcore/ripple/liftop/rockb/rocksh -> s3; land/orb/well/echo/lock/splash/dense -> atk.\n- ex: ring/ring_frag -> s1 (ring_s1_gd); ring_splash/hit_x -> talent (溅射/额外弹/连锁); halo/smoke/steam -> s3 (过载/过热); bless -> talent.\n- ey: ignite + aura -> s2 (引燃); lava/pool -> s3; boom/splash/ball_* serve atk + s1 tri variants -> atk.\n- gl: slash/geyser/ram/splash -> talent (branch/late_shape guesses); pop -> s3.\n- hsg: sand -> s2 (荆棘 热砂; node 热砂·落刃 reuses); pulse (般若之重/盾墙反震) -> talent.\n- ir: gust/nova -> s1 (起风); boom/muz (手炮) + brand (严律) + gale/tide3 (branch) -> talent.\n- ka: heal* -> atk (her basic heal; heal_cross also used by link); guard (精二回防) -> talent; echo/smol -> s3 (熔毁).\n- lg: exec (殁亡处决) / tick (提喻) -> s2 is a guess; fire/hit/hits -> atk.\n- lm: burst/tower/pulse -> s3 (灯火不灭); drizzle/rain -> s1; mend/flare -> atk.\n- lp: atk_h/arm/block -> s1 (日晷 回敬/格挡); wolf -> s2 (狼魂 waves); xcut (噤声 观察刻满) -> s3; bark/spread (断喝) -> talent.\n- mz: tentacle forms slam/curl=atk, pierce=s1, big=s3, cluster=link; coil -> s2; jelly/sting (深蓝之籽) + awk2 -> talent.\n- sa: cbash/cal*/field -> s3 (钙质化); hot_* -> s2; orb/chip/markb/pil*/shat2/qspk -> talent.\n- sg: crk_* -> s2 (跃空锤 cracks); cmd (万兽之王) / quake / crash / rift / wave_s* -> talent.\n- skadi?: spin -> atk (also used by S3 big spin and link); swell/swell2/nutao/backwash/wallbrk/blade/pulse -> talent (涌潮/跃浪 branch).\n- su: bare saw -> atk; dollin -> s2; dollout/dollpulse -> talent (替身光环).\n- sz: fl*/tuft -> s2 (guess); drop/bigfox -> s3; pray/hb -> talent (祈愿/围炉).\n- tx: array -> s1 (r65; r56 copy used by S3); spin (骤雨/回马剑) -> talent; sw_s16/s19/s40 -> s1.\n- ul: echo/whirl/small -> talent (定点爆破/锁链回旋/通路洞开·余震); quake (撼地 every swing) -> atk.\n- wd: glint -> s1 (glintb -> s3); mzg -> s3 (巨炮 muzzle, also link 起手); sb/shade/smz/pop -> atk (精一/精二 残影/魂炮).\nLegacy map: short prefixes fx_irv/ir/la/lo/lu/sa/sp/sz/sk/sd/mz/sg/an/ey/ws/hs are old ult_moves*/ult_fx_c strips (some reused by link_fx_a/b); fx_ul_* cracks/dust reused across ops -> shared. Match longest prefix first (e.g. fx_exusiai_hit_s1 overrides fx_exusiai). Full-name optical prefixes marked 'other' when they mix moves."
}